<doc id="181160" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=181160" title="Kyushu Railway Company">
Kyushu Railway Company

Kyushu Railway Company (九州旅客鉄道株式会社, Kyūshū Ryokaku Tetsudō Kabushiki-gaisha), uga diarani kanthi jeneng JR Kyushu (JR九州, Jeiāru Kyūshū), yaiku salah siji saka pitu perusahaan konstituen saka &lt;a href="Japan%20Railways%20Group"&gt;Japan Railways Group&lt;/a&gt; (JR Group). Perusahaan iki ngoperasikake layanan &lt;a href="intercity%20rail"&gt;intercity rail&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Kyushu"&gt;Kyushu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt; lan layanan nyabrang &lt;a href="JR%20Kyushu%20Jet%20Ferry"&gt;JR Kyushu Jet Ferry&lt;/a&gt; Beetle &lt;a href="nydrofoil"&gt;nydrofoil&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Selat%20Tsushima"&gt;Selat Tsushima&lt;/a&gt; antarane &lt;a href="Fukuoka%2C%20Fukuoka"&gt;Fukuoka&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Busan"&gt;Busan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Korea%20Kidul"&gt;Korea Kidul&lt;/a&gt;. Uga ngoperasikake hotel, restoran, lan toko obat ing wilayah layanane.
Markas JR Kyushu ana ing &lt;a href="Hakata-ku%2C%20Fukuoka"&gt;Hakata-ku, Fukuoka&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Nalika &lt;a href="Japanese%20National%20Railways"&gt;Japanese National Railways&lt;/a&gt; dipérang ing taun 1987, Kyushu Railway Company marisi aset lan operasi ing pulo &lt;a href="Kyushu"&gt;Kyushu&lt;/a&gt; bebarengan karo kerugian watara 28,8 milyar yen, diperparah dening jaringan dalan gedhe ing Kyushu lan akeh tilase dalan deso sing arang digunakake. Sawise privatisasi, JR Kyushu nggawe macem-macem bisnis dadi usaha anyar kayata budidaya iwak lan jamur lan dodolan mobil.
Loro usaha sampingan sing luwih sukses yaiku &lt;a href="JR%20Kyushu%20Jet%20Ferry"&gt;Beetle ferry&lt;/a&gt;, diwiwiti ing taun 1991, lan jaringan toko roti Train d'or, diwiwiti ing taun 1992. JR Kyushu uga mbangun layanan sepur premium liwat pangembangan sepur &lt;a href="Kyushu%20Shinkansen"&gt;Kyushu Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sepur%20kacepetan%20dhuwur"&gt;sepur kacepetan dhuwur&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Seven%20Stars%20in%20Kyushu"&gt;Seven Stars in Kyushu&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sepur%20wisata"&gt;sepur wisata&lt;/a&gt; mewah.
Perusahaan ngenalake &lt;a href="SUGOCA"&gt;SUGOCA&lt;/a&gt;, sistem tiket &lt;a href="smart%20card"&gt;smart card&lt;/a&gt;, wiwit tanggal 1 Maret 2009.
