<doc id="181185" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=181185" title="West Japan Railway Company">
West Japan Railway Company

West Japan Railway Company (西日本旅客鉄道株式会社, Nishi-Nihon Ryokaku Tetsudō kabushiki gaisha, lit. "Perusahaan Sepur Jepang Kulon"), uga diarani kanthi jeneng JR West (JR西日本, Jeiāru Nishi-Nihon), yaiku salah sawijining perusahaan &lt;a href="Japan%20Railways%20Group"&gt;Japan Railways Group&lt;/a&gt; (JR Group) lan makarya ing sisih kulon &lt;a href="Honshu"&gt;Honshu&lt;/a&gt;. Kantor pusaté ana ing &lt;a href="Kita-ku%2C%20Osaka"&gt;Kita-ku, Osaka&lt;/a&gt;
<h2>Jalur</h2>
<h3>Shinkansen</h3>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Hokuriku%20Shinkansen"&gt;Hokuriku Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20J%C5%8Detsumy%C5%8Dk%C5%8D"&gt;Jōetsumyōkō&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Tsuruga"&gt;Tsuruga&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="San%27y%C5%8D%20Shinkansen"&gt;San'yō Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Hakata%20Minami%20Line"&gt;Jalur Minami Hakata&lt;/a&gt;</li>
 Sacara resmi bukan &lt;a href="Shinkansen"&gt;Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; jalur paling laris JR-West iku jalur &lt;a href="high-speed%20rail"&gt;high-speed rail&lt;/a&gt; Sanyo Shinkansen antarane &lt;a href="Osaka"&gt;Osaka&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Fukuoka%2C%20Fukuoka"&gt;Fukuoka&lt;/a&gt;. Sanyo Shinkansen mung udakara nyumbang 40% saka bathi penumpang JR-West. Perusahaan iki uga ngoperasikaké &lt;a href="Hakata%20Minami%20Line"&gt;Jalur Hakata Minami&lt;/a&gt;, sawijining jalur commuter cendhak karo sepur Shinkansen ing &lt;a href="Fukuoka%2C%20Fukuoka"&gt;Fukuoka&lt;/a&gt;.
</ul>
<h3>Urban Network</h3>
Jalur.
Urban Network.
"Urban Network" iku jeneng JR-West kanggo jalur &lt;a href="commuter%20rail"&gt;commuter rail&lt;/a&gt; ing wilayah metropolitan &lt;a href="Osaka-Kobe-Kyoto"&gt;Osaka-Kobe-Kyoto&lt;/a&gt;. Jalur iki bebarengan kalebu 610&amp;nbsp;km trek, duwe 245 stasiun lan nyumbang kira-kira 43% saka bathi penumpang JR-West. Stasiun Urban Network dilengkapi kanggo nangani kertu tarif &lt;a href="ICOCA"&gt;ICOCA&lt;/a&gt;. Kontrol sepur ing jalur kasebut otomatis, lan sajrone jam sibuk, sepur lumaku saben rong menit.
Urban Network JR-West saingan karo sawetara operator commuter rail swasta ing sekitar Osaka, "Big 4" yaiku &lt;a href="Hankyu%20Railway"&gt;Hankyu Railway&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a href="Hanshin%20Railway"&gt;Hanshin Railway&lt;/a&gt; (Hankyu tuku Hanshin ing April 2005), &lt;a href="Keihan%20Railway"&gt;Keihan Railway&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kintetsu%20Railway"&gt;Kintetsu&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Nankai%20Railway"&gt;Nankai Railway&lt;/a&gt;. Pangsa pasar JR-West ing wilayah kasebut kira-kira padha karo Big 4 sing digabungake, umume amarga jaringan lengkap lan sepur high-speed commuter (Layanan Special Rapid ing jalur Kobe lan Kyoto beroperasi nganti 130&amp;nbsp;km/h).
