<doc id="181247" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=181247" title="Central Japan Railway Company">
Central Japan Railway Company

Central Japan Railway Company (東海旅客鉄道株式会社, Tōkai Ryokaku Tetsudō kabushiki gaisha, lit. "&lt;a href="T%C5%8Dkai"&gt;Tōkai&lt;/a&gt; Passenger Railway Stock Company") yaiku perusahaan sepur utama sing beroperasi ing wilayah &lt;a href="Ch%C5%ABbu"&gt;Chūbu&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Nagoya"&gt;Nagoya&lt;/a&gt;) ing Jepang tengah. Iki sacara resmi disingkat ing basa Inggris minangka JR Central lan ing basa Jepang minangka JR Tōkai (#ALIH). Tōkai minangka referensi kanggo &lt;a href="T%C5%8Dkai"&gt;wilayah geografis&lt;/a&gt; ing ngendi perusahaan kasebut beroperasi.
Pusat operasional JR Central ing &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Nagoya"&gt;Stasiun Nagoya&lt;/a&gt; lan kantor administratif perusahaan dumunung ing &lt;a href="JR%20Central%20Towers"&gt;JR Central Towers&lt;/a&gt; ing ndhuwur stasiun. Jalur sepur paling rame lan paling dawa sing dioperasikake JR Central yaiku &lt;a href="T%C5%8Dkaid%C5%8D%20Main%20Line"&gt;Jalur Utama Tōkaidō&lt;/a&gt; antarane &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Atami"&gt;Atami&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Maibara"&gt;Maibara&lt;/a&gt;. Perusahaan iku uga ngoperasikaké &lt;a href="T%C5%8Dkaid%C5%8D%20Shinkansen"&gt;Tōkaidō Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; antarane &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Shin-%C5%8Csaka"&gt;Shin-Ōsaka&lt;/a&gt;. Kajaba iku, uga tanggung jawab kanggo layanan &lt;a href="Ch%C5%AB%C5%8D%20Shinkansen"&gt;Chūō Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;— &lt;a href="Sepur%20Maglev"&gt;maglev&lt;/a&gt; antarane &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Osaka"&gt;Osaka&lt;/a&gt;, sing bakal miwiti operasi antarane Tokyo lan Nagoya ing 2027.
