<doc id="181268" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=181268" title="East Japan Railway Company">
East Japan Railway Company

East Japan Railway Company (東日本旅客鉄道株式会社, Higashi-Nihon Ryokaku Tetsudō kabushiki gaisha) yaiku sawijining perusahaan sepur penumpang utama ing Jepang lan minangka sing paling gedhé saka pitung perusahaan &lt;a href="Japan%20Railways%20Group"&gt;Japan Railways Group&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng perusahaan kasebut kanthi resmi disingkat dadi JR-EAST utawa JR East ing basa Inggris lan JR Higashi-Nihon (JR東日本, Jeiāru Higashi-Nihon) ing basa Jepang. Kantor pusat perusahaan ana ing &lt;a href="Yoyogi"&gt;Yoyogi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Shibuya"&gt;Shibuya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;, lan ing jejere &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Shinjuku"&gt;Stasiun Shinjuku&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
JR East didegaké tanggal 1 April 1987 sawisé dipisahaké saka &lt;a href="Japanese%20National%20Railways"&gt;Japanese National Railways&lt;/a&gt; (JNR). Pamisahan kasebut kanthi nominal "privatisasi", amarga perusahaan kasebut sejatine minangka anak perusahaan sing diduweni kabeh saka pamarentah &lt;a href="Japanese%20National%20Railway%20Settlement%20Corporation"&gt;JNR Settlement Corporation&lt;/a&gt; kanggo sawetara taun, lan ora didol kanthi lengkap nganti taun 2002.
Sawisé pambubaran, JR East nglakokaké operasi ing bekas jalur JNR ing &lt;a href="Tokyo%20Raya"&gt;Tokyo Raya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="T%C5%8Dhoku"&gt;Tōhoku&lt;/a&gt;, lan sakubengé.
<h2>Jalur</h2>
Jalur.
Jalur sepur JR East utamané nglayani &lt;a href="Kant%C5%8D"&gt;Kanto&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="T%C5%8Dhoku"&gt;Tohoku&lt;/a&gt; bebarengan karo wilayah jejer ing wilayah &lt;a href="K%C5%8Dshin%27etsu"&gt;Kōshin'etsu&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Prefektur%20Niigata"&gt;Niigata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Nagano"&gt;Nagano&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Yamanashi"&gt;Yamanashi&lt;/a&gt;) lan &lt;a href="Prat%C3%A9lan%20pr%C3%A9f%C3%A8ktur%20ing%20Jepang"&gt;prefektur&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Shizuoka"&gt;Shizuoka&lt;/a&gt;.
<h3>Shinkansen</h3>
Shinkansen.
JR East ngoperasèkaké kabeh &lt;a href="Shinkansen"&gt;Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;, jalur sepur kacepetan dhuwur ing sisih lor Tokyo, kajaba &lt;a href="Hokkaido%20Shinkansen"&gt;Hokkaido Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;, sing dioperasèkaké &lt;a href="Hokkaido%20Railway%20Company"&gt;JR Hokkaido&lt;/a&gt;.
<ul>
