<doc id="181347" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=181347" title="Yohanes Pambaptis">
Yohanes Pambaptis

Yohanes Pambaptis (&lt;a href="basa%20Aram"&gt;basa Aram&lt;/a&gt;: יוחנן שליחא‎ Yohanān Shliḥā; #ALIH‎
 Yohanān HaMatbil; &lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: يوحنا المعمدان‎‎ Yuhanna Al-Ma'madan; &lt;a href="Basa%20Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt;: Βαπτιστής Ἰωάννης Baptistḗs Ioánnes, utawa Ἰωάννης ὁ βαπτίζων Iōánnēs ho baptízōn, utawa Ἰωάννης ὁ πρόδρομος Iōánnēs ho pródromos; #ALIH utawa ⲓⲱ̅ⲁ ⲡⲓⲣϥϯⲱⲙⲥ; &lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Ioannes Baptista; &lt;a href="basa%20Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;: John the Baptist) yaiku guru lan panginjil misuwur ing &lt;a href="Yudea%20%28provinsi%20Romawi%29"&gt;Provinsi Yudea&lt;/a&gt; ing abad ping 1 M sing kecathet riwayatae ing bagean &lt;a href="Prajanjian%20Anyar"&gt;Prajanjian Anyar&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Alkitab"&gt;Alkitab&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kristen"&gt;Kristen&lt;/a&gt;. Ia menika katurunan &lt;a href="suku%20Lewi"&gt;suku Lewi&lt;/a&gt;, putra saka &lt;a href="Elisabet"&gt;Elisabet&lt;/a&gt;, sedulur sepupu &lt;a href="Maria"&gt;Maria&lt;/a&gt;, ibu &lt;a href="Yesus"&gt;Yesus&lt;/a&gt;. Ramane, &lt;a href="Zakharia%20%28imam%29"&gt;Zakharia&lt;/a&gt; yaiku imam saka rombongan &lt;a href="Suku%20Lewi%23Rombongan%20Imam"&gt;Abia&lt;/a&gt; sing ditugasake ing &lt;a href="Bait%20kapindho"&gt;Bait Allah&lt;/a&gt;. Ing &lt;a href="Katulik"&gt;Katulik&lt;/a&gt;, Yohanes dilambangke minangka pertapa sing nganggo sandhangan saka wulu domba sing lagi martakake lan sebelahan karo domba lan tanggal peringatane yaiku &lt;a href="24%20Juni"&gt;24 Juni&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="29%20Agustus"&gt;29 Agustus&lt;/a&gt;.
