<doc id="181651" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=181651" title="Kabiskopan Agung São Sebastião do Rio de Janeiro">
Kabiskopan Agung São Sebastião do Rio de Janeiro

Ana uga kabiskopan Rio de Janeiro (lan Biskop Rio de Janeiro) ing &lt;a href="Greja%20Episkopal%20Anglikan%20Brasil"&gt;Greja Episkopal Anglikan Brasil&lt;/a&gt;.
<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Kabiskopan Agung São Sebastião do Rio de Janeiro (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Archidioecesis Sancti Sebastiani Fluminis Ianuarii, tegese "Kabiskopan Agung Santo Sebastian saka Rio de Janeiro") ing &lt;a href="Brasil"&gt;Brasil&lt;/a&gt; didegake minangka &lt;a href="prelatus%20teritorial"&gt;prelatur teritorial&lt;/a&gt; ing 19 Juli 1575. Kawasan prelatur kasebut ditingkatake dadi &lt;a href="kabiskopan"&gt;kabiskopan&lt;/a&gt; ing 16 November 1676. Kabiskopan kasebut banjur ditingkatake dadi kabiskopan agung metropolitan ing 27 April 1892. Ing 6 Mei 2003, kawasan &lt;a href="biara%20keabasan"&gt;biara keabasan&lt;/a&gt; teritorial Nossa Senhora do Monserrate do Rio de Janeiro kelangan pangkat teritoriale lan dileboke ing kabiskopan kasebut. Kardinal &lt;a href="Orani%20Jo%C3%A3o%20Tempesta"&gt;Orani João Tempesta&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="O.%20Cist."&gt;O. Cist.&lt;/a&gt; dadi Biskop Agung-ne sawise 2009. Kardinal &lt;a href="Eus%C3%A9bio%20Scheid"&gt;Eusébio Scheid&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Dehonian"&gt;S.C.I.&lt;/a&gt; dadi Biskop Agung &lt;a href="Emeritus"&gt;Emeritus&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Pranala jaba</h2>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="http%3A//www.catholic-hierarchy.org/diocese/dsase.html"&gt;Keuskupan Agung São Sebastião do Rio de Janeiro&lt;/a&gt; di Catholic Hierarchy</li>
</ul>

</doc>
