Perhimpunan Rembulan Sabit Abang Palestina didegake ing 1968, dening &lt;a href="Fathi%20Arafat"&gt;Fathi Arafat&lt;/a&gt;, saudara &lt;a href="Yasser%20Arafat"&gt;Yasser Arafat&lt;/a&gt;. Organisasi kasebut menika &lt;a href="organisasi%20kamanungsan"&gt;organisasi kamanungsan&lt;/a&gt; sing dadi bagean saka &lt;a href="Gerakan%20Palang%20Abang%20lan%20Rembulan%20Sabit%20Abang%20Internasional"&gt;Gerakan Palang Abang lan Rembulan Sabit Abang Internasional&lt;/a&gt;. Organisasi kasebut nyediakake rumah sakit, pengubatan darurat lan jasa ambulan, lan pusat perawatan kesehatan primer ing &lt;a href="Gisik%20Kulon"&gt;Gisik Kulon&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Lurung%20Gaza"&gt;Lurung Gaza&lt;/a&gt;. Markas gedhene ana ing &lt;a href="Ramallah"&gt;Ramallah&lt;/a&gt;, cedhak &lt;a href="Yerusalem"&gt;Yerusalem&lt;/a&gt;.
