Karminadle

Karminadle, gehaktyz, karbinadle, kardinadle - sajian &lt;a href="Olahan%20Silesia"&gt;Silesian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20glindhing"&gt;bakso&lt;/a&gt; tradisional disiapake saka &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;. Sing kasebut ing ndhuwur nyipta karminadle tradisional, disuguhake karo &lt;a href="Pur%C3%A9"&gt;puree&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kasha"&gt;kasza&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;beras&lt;/a&gt;. 
Umumé, &lt;a href="Cutlet"&gt;karminadle&lt;/a&gt; minangka irisan cilik, bunder lan asring digawe saka &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, sanajan luwih umum saka daging &lt;a href="Kelinci"&gt;terwelu&lt;/a&gt;, amarga tradisi breeding terwelu ing &lt;a href="Silesia%20ndhuwur"&gt;Silesia Upper&lt;/a&gt;. Biyen, &lt;a href="preian"&gt;karminadle&lt;/a&gt; minangka sajian mung preian, sing saiki disedhiyakake ing dina biasa. 
Karminadle, diiris setengah, bisa disedhiyakake ing &lt;a href="roti"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="roti%20gulung"&gt;roti gulung&lt;/a&gt;. 
