<doc id="182301" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182301" title="Kabiskopan Taichung">
Kabiskopan Taichung

Kabiskopan Taichung (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Dioecesis Taichungensis) yaiku &lt;a href="kabiskopan"&gt;kabiskopan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Ritus%20Latin"&gt;Ritus Latin&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Greja%20Katulik%20Roma"&gt;Greja Katulik Roma&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Taiwan"&gt;Taiwan&lt;/a&gt;. Awale didegake minangka Prefektur Apostolik &lt;a href="Taichung"&gt;Taichung&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1950, Prefektur kasebut ditingkatake dadi kabiskopan penuh ing taun 1962. Kabiskopan kasebut menika sufragan saka &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Agung%20Taipei"&gt;Kabiskopan Agung Taipei&lt;/a&gt;. Biskop saiki yaiku Martin Su Yao-wen sawise Juni 2007.
<h2>Kronologi</h2>
<ul>
<li>Didegake minangka Prefektur Apostolik Taichung ing 10 Agustus 1950, misah saka &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Kaohsiung"&gt;Prefektur Apostolik Kaohsiung&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Ditingkatake minangka Kabiskopan Taichung ing 16 April 1962</li>
</ul>
<h2>Ordinaris</h2>
<h3>Prefek Apostolik Taichung</h3>
<ul>
<li>Rm. &lt;a href="William%20Francis%20Kupfer"&gt;William Francis Kupfer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Maryknoll"&gt;M.M.&lt;/a&gt; (蔡文興) (26 Januari 1951 – 16 April 1962, diangkat dadi Biskop Taichung)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Uskup Taichung</h3>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="William%20Francis%20Kupfer"&gt;William Francis Kupfer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Maryknoll"&gt;M.M.&lt;/a&gt; (蔡文興) (16 April 1962 – 25 Juni 1986, pensiyun)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Joseph%20Wang%20Yu-jung"&gt;Joseph Wang Yu-jung&lt;/a&gt; (王愈榮) (25 Juni 1986 – 25 Juni 2007, pensiyun)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Martin%20Su%20Yao-wen"&gt;Martin Su Yao-wen&lt;/a&gt; (蘇耀文) (25 Jun 2007 – saiki)</li>
</ul>
