<doc id="182302" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182302" title="In persona episcopi">
In persona episcopi

In persona episcopi (&lt;a href="basa%20Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;: Ing siji wong biskop) yaiku sebutan &lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt; sing dikanggo dening &lt;a href="Greja%20Katulik%20Roma"&gt;Greja Katulik Roma&lt;/a&gt; kanggo nyebut pamanunggalan loro &lt;a href="kabiskopan"&gt;kabiskopan&lt;/a&gt; utawa luwih sing endi kabiskopan-kabiskopan kasebut diurus dening siji biskop nanging orang ngubah struktur diosesan mereka (kayata &lt;a href="seminari"&gt;seminari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="katedral"&gt;katedral&lt;/a&gt;, kantor kuria). Biasane, pamanunggalan kasebut isa sak wetoro, nanging ing kasus liyane isa dadi pamanunggalan &lt;a href="aeque%20principaliter"&gt;aeque principaliter&lt;/a&gt; utawa pamanunggalan penuh.
<h2>Conto</h2>
<ul>
<li>Itali: &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Fossano"&gt;Fossano&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Cuneo"&gt;Cuneo&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Kanada: &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Moosonee"&gt;Moosonee&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Hearst"&gt;Hearst&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Kanada: &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Agung%20Ottawa"&gt;Ottawa&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Alexandria-Cornwall"&gt;Alexandria-Cornwall&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Spanyol: &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Huesca"&gt;Huesca&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Jaca"&gt;Jaca&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Amerika Sarekat: &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Agung%20Baltimore"&gt;Baltimore&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Agung%20Washington"&gt;Washington&lt;/a&gt; (1939–1947)</li>
</ul>
